#: src/postulo/plugins/messaging_contacts/__init__.py
msgid "Keep the ways you and the people you deal with are reached on Matrix, XMPP, Signal, Telegram, Threema or another messaging service, as many as you like, one of them marked as the one to use. Switched off, Postulo offers none; the ones already recorded stay and come back untouched when it is switched on again."
msgstr "Coinnigh na bealaí ar féidir teacht ortsa agus ar na daoine a mbíonn tú ag déileáil leo ar Matrix, XMPP, Signal, Telegram, Threema nó seirbhís teachtaireachtaí eile, an oiread acu agus is mian leat, le ceann acu marcáilte mar an ceann le húsáid. Múchta, ní thairgeann Postulo aon cheann acu; fanann na cinn atá taifeadta cheana agus tagann siad ar ais gan athrú nuair a chuirtear ar siúl arís é."

#: src/postulo/plugins/messaging_contacts/__init__.py
msgid "Multiple messaging contacts"
msgstr "Teagmhálacha teachtaireachtaí iolracha"
